{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:0.1"], "en": "The Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:0.2"], "en": "Catukkanipāta,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:0.3"], "en": "Cūḷakuṇālavagga (The Short Kuṇāla Chapter)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:0.4", "PA_ja_345:1.1"], "en": "5. The Gajakumbha Jātaka “The fire that burns the forest,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:1.2"], "en": "the flame with its blackened trail— ”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:1.3"], "en": "“How do you act, Pacalaka?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:1.4"], "en": "You are so slow in your exertion.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:2.1"], "en": "“There are many openings in the trees,” [he replied].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:2.2"], "en": "And the fissures in the earth—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:2.3"], "en": "if we do not overcome these,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:2.4"], "en": "it will be our time to pass away.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:3.1"], "en": "“He who hastens when he should delay,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:3.2"], "en": "and delays when he should hasten—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:3.3"], "en": "like one treading upon a dry leaf— ”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:3.4"], "en": "He ruins his own welfare,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:4.1"], "en": "he who delays when there should be delay,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:4.2"], "en": "yet hastens when it is time to cross over.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:4.3"], "en": "“Dividing the night like the moon,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:4.4"], "en": "his purpose is fulfilled.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_345:5.1"], "en": "Thus ends the fifth Jātaka, the Gajakumbha Jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
